#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cantor; features"
msgstr "&cantor; značajke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Intuitive worksheet view for evaluating expressions."
msgstr "Intuitivni radnom pregledu za račun izraza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Results of graph plotting shown inside the worksheet."
msgstr "Rezultate grafikona pokazuje unutar radnog lista."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "Easy plugin-based structure to allow different backends to be added."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavni plugin-baziran na strukturi dozvoljava drugačiju sistemsku "
"podršku da se doda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"GetHotNewStuff integration to allow example worksheets to be downloaded (or "
"uploaded.)"
msgstr ""
"GetHotNewStuff integracija dozvoljava primjere radnog lista da budu uvezeni "
"(ili izvezeni)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mathematical formula typesetting using &latex;."
msgstr "Matematička formula pripremljena pomoću &latex;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Backend-aware syntax highlighting."
msgstr "Backend-svjesno isticanje sintakse."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plugin-based assistant dialogs to help with common tasks, such as "
"integrating a function, or entering a matrix."
msgstr ""
"Plugin-baziran na asistirajućem dijalogu za pomoć u uobičajnim zadatcima, "
"kao integracija funkcije, ili ulazak u matricu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &cantor; backends"
msgstr "&cantor; backends"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cantor; offers you several choices for the backends you wish to use with "
"it. The choice to make depends on what you want to achieve."
msgstr ""
"&cantor; nudi više izbora za backends koji želite da koristite. Izbor zavisi "
"od tog šta želite da spijete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currently the following backends are available:"
msgstr "Trenutno su dostupni ovi backends:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sage:"
msgstr "Sage:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sage is a free open-source mathematics software system licensed under the "
"GPL. It combines the power of many existing open-source packages, within a "
"common Python-based interface. See <ulink url=\"http://sagemath.org\">http://"
"sagemath.org</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Sage je besplatni matematički softverski sistem s licencom od GPL. On "
"kombinira moć već postojećih izvora paketa, sa Python-baziranim interfejsom. "
"Pogledajte <ulink url=\"http://sagemath.org\">http://sagemath.org</ulink> za "
"više informacija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maxima:"
msgstr "Maxima:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Maxima is a system for the manipulation of symbolic and numeric expressions, "
"including differentiation, integration, Taylor series, Laplace transforms, "
"ordinary differential equations, systems of linear equations, polynomials, "
"sets, lists, vectors, matrices, and tensors. Maxima yields high-precision "
"numeric results by using exact fractions, arbitrary precision integers, and "
"variable precision floating point numbers. Maxima can plot functions and "
"data in two and three dimensions. See <ulink url=\"http://maxima.sourceforge."
"net\">http://maxima.sourceforge.net</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Maxima je sistem za manipulaciju simbola i numeričkih izraza, uključujuči "
"izvode, integrale, Taylor nizove, Laplace transformacije, obične "
"diferencijalne jednadžbe, sisteme linearnih jednadžbi, polinome, skupove, "
"liste, vektore, matrice i tenzore. Maxima prinosi veliku-preciznosti "
"numeričkih rezultata koristeći tačne frakcije, proizvoljnu preciznost "
"integrala, i varijabilnu preciznost brojeva sa pomičnim zarezom."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>R:</term>"
msgstr "<term>R:</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"R is a language and environment for statistical computing and graphics, "
"similar to the S language and environment. It provides a wide variety of "
"statistical (linear and nonlinear modelling, classical statistical tests, "
"time-series analysis, classification, clustering, ...) and graphical "
"techniques, and is highly extensible. The S language is often the vehicle of "
"choice for research in statistical methodology, and R provides an open-"
"source route to this. See <ulink url=\"http://www.r-project.org\">http://www."
"r-project.org</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"R je jezik i okruženje za statističko računanje i grafičko, slično sa S "
"jezikom i okruženjem. Pruža više varijacija statističkog  (linearnog i "
"nelinearnog modeliranja, klasični statistički testovi, vremenske-serije "
"analize, klasifikacija, clustering, ...) i grafičke tehnike, i visoko "
"proširive. S jezik je uobičajno program za pretraživanje načina u statistici."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalgebra;:"
msgstr "&kalgebra;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalgebra; is a MathML-based graph calculator, that ships with &kde; "
"Education project. See <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/\">http://"
"edu.kde.org/kalgebra/</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"&kalgebra; je MathM-bazni grafički kalkulator, koji dolazi sa &kde; "
"Obrazovni program. Pogledajte <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/"
"\">http://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/</ulink>za više informacija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Qalculate!:"
msgstr "Qalculate!:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Qalculate! is not your regular software replication of the cheapest "
"available calculator. Qalculate! aims to make full use of the superior "
"interface, power and flexibility of modern computers. The center of "
"attention in Qalculate! is the expression entry. Instead of entering each "
"number in a mathematical expression separately, you can directly write the "
"whole expression and later modify it. The interpretation of expressions is "
"flexible and fault tolerant, and if you nevertheless do something wrong, "
"Qalculate! will tell you so. Not fully solvable expressions are however not "
"errors. Qalculate! will simplify as far as it can and answer with an "
"expression. In addition to numbers and arithmetic operators, an expression "
"may contain any combination of variables, units, and functions. See <ulink "
"url=\"http://qalculate.sourceforge.net/\">http://qalculate.sourceforge.net/</"
"ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Qalculate! nije vaš obična softverska replikacija od najjeftinijeg "
"kalkulatora. Qalculate! ima za cilj da iskoristi u potpunosti interfejs, moć "
"i fleksibilnost modernog računara. U centru pažnje programa Qalculate!  je "
"unos izraza. Umjesto unošenja svakog broja u matematičko računanje odvojeno, "
"možete direktno napisati cijeli izraz i kasnije ga modifikovati. "
"Interpretacija izraza je otporna na kvarove, i ako vi nešto uradite pogrešno."
"Qalculate!! će vam reći tako. Ni potpuno ne rješiv izraz nije greška. "
"Qalculate! će pojednostaviti koliko god može odgovor na pitanje. Kao dodatak "
"brojevima i artimetičkim operacijama, izraz može sadržavati više kombinacija "
"varijabli, jedinica, i funkcija. Pogledajte<ulink url=\"http://qalculate."
"sourceforge.net/\">http://qalculate.sourceforge.net/</ulink> za više "
"informacija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Python2:"
msgstr "Python2:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Python is a remarkably powerful dynamic programming language that is used in "
"a wide variety of application domains. There are several Python packages to "
"scientific programming."
msgstr ""
"Python je izvanredno moćan dinamički programski jezik koji se koristi u više "
"aplikacija. Postoji više Python paketa za naučno programiranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Python is distributed under Python Software Foundation license (GPL "
"compatible). See the <ulink url=\"http://www.python.org/\">official website</"
"ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Python je distribuisan ispod Python Software Foundation licence (GPL "
"compatible).Pogledajte  <ulink url=\"http://www.python.org/\">official "
"website</ulink>za više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This backend adds an additional item to the &cantor;'s main menu, "
"<guimenu>Package</guimenu>. The only item of this menu is "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Package</guimenu><guimenuitem>Import Package</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This item can be used to import Python packages "
"to the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj backend dodaje i dodatnu stavku u &cantor;'s glavni izbornika,"
"<guimenu>Paket</guimenu>. Jedina stavko ovog izbornika je "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Packet</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uvoz paketa</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. Ova stavka se može koristiti za uvoz Python paketa u radni list."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "This backend supports Python 2 only."
msgstr "Ovaj backend podržava samo Python 2."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scilab:"
msgstr "Scilab:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scilab is an free software, cross-platform numerical computational package "
"and a high-level, numerically oriented programming language."
msgstr ""
"Scilab je besplatan softver,  cross-platform računske numeričke pakete na "
"visokom nivou, numerički orientisan programski jezik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scilab is distributed under CeCILL license (GPL compatible). See <ulink url="
"\"http://www.scilab.org/\">http://www.scilab.org/</ulink> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Scilab je distribute pod CeCILL licencom(GPL compatible). Pogledajte<ulink "
"url=\"http://www.scilab.org/\">http://www.scilab.org/</ulink> za više "
"informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need Scilab version 5.5 or higher to be installed in your system to make "
"this backend usable."
msgstr ""
"Potrebana vam je Scilab  verzija 5.5 ili viša da se instalira na vaš sistem "
"da bi backende bilo od koristi."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Octave:"
msgstr "Octave:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&GNU; Octave is a high-level language, primarily intended for numerical "
"computations. It provides a convenient command line interface for solving "
"linear and nonlinear problems numerically, and for performing other "
"numerical experiments using a language that is mostly compatible with <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.mathworks.com/products/matlab/\">MATLAB</ulink>. See <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/octave/\">http://www.gnu.org/software/"
"octave/</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"&GNU; Octave je jezik visokog nivosa, primarne funkcije za numeričke "
"računice. Ona pruža zgodna rješenja za linearne i nelinearne numeričke "
"probleme, i za rad drugih numeričkih eksperimenata koristeći jezik koji je "
"najviše kompatibilan sa <ulink url=\"http://www.mathworks.com/products/"
"matlab/\">MATLAB</ulink>. Pogledajte <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/"
"software/octave/\">http://www.gnu.org/software/octave/</ulink> za više "
"informacija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lua:"
msgstr "Lua:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lua is a fast and lightweight scripting language, with a simple procedural "
"syntax. There are several libraries in Lua aimed at math and science."
msgstr ""
"Lua je brzi lagano skriptirajući jezik, sa jednostvnom sintaksnim "
"procedurom. Postoji par biblioteka u Lua ciljevima u matematici i nauci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See <ulink url=\"http://www.lua.org/\">http://www.lua.org/</ulink> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajete <ulink url=\"http://www.lua.org/\">http://www.lua.org/</ulink>za "
"više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This backend supports <ulink url=\"http://luajit.org/\">luajit 2</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj backend podržava <ulink url=\"http://luajit.org/\">luajit 2</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &cantor; Workspace"
msgstr "&cantor;  Prostor za rad"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; Workspace</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Slika ekrana od &cantor; Radni prostor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; Workspace</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika ekrana od  &cantor; Radni prostor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Worksheet interface of &cantor; consists of three parts:"
msgstr "Radni list sučeljenje od  &cantor; sastoji se od tri dijela:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tab bar, where you can switch through the open worksheets."
msgstr "Tab bar, gdje možete mijenjati kroz otvoren radni list."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A help panel, where help for a specific command is displayed if you enter "
"\"? command\"."
msgstr ""
"Pomoćni panel, pomoć za specifićne komande prikazane ako uđete \"? command\"."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Variable Manager panel where you can see the list of all available "
"variables on the current worksheet. The Help and Variable Manager panels are "
"shown as tabs on a sidebar of a &cantor; window. Variable manager can be "
"used for Maxima (if enabled on <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"<guilabel>Maxima</guilabel> page), &kalgebra;, Octave, Python2, Qalculate, "
"and Scilab backends only."
msgstr ""
"A Variable Manager ploča gdje možete vidjeti listu dostupnih varijabli na "
"trenutnom radnom listu. Pomoć i Variable Manager ploča je prikazana kao tabs "
"na sidebaru od &cantor; prozora. Variable menager može se koristiti za "
"Maxima  <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguracija "
"&cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> <guilabel>Maxima</guilabel> page), "
"&kalgebra;, Octave, Python2, Qalculate, and Scilab backends samo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "The worksheet itself."
msgstr "Radni list."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Worksheet"
msgstr "Radni list"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The worksheet is the basic area for working with &cantor;. Using it, you can "
"enter expressions, allow the backend to perform calculations, and look at "
"the results. The commands the worksheets accept depend on the chosen "
"backend, so you should learn the appropriate backend syntax (the Show Help "
"button takes you there directly). If you know the command, but you need "
"additional information, you can type \"? <replaceable>command</replaceable>"
"\", and contextual help will appear on the right of the worksheet. If you "
"want to see some example worksheets, you can go to <guimenuitem>Download "
"Example Worksheets</guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu, and "
"download worksheets other users have published."
msgstr ""
"Radni list je osnovana arena za rad sa &cantor;. Koristeći to, možete ući u "
"izraz, dozvoli backend da izvede kalkulacije, i traži rezultat. Komandu koju "
"radni list prihvata zavisi od izabranog backend, tako da trebate naučiti "
"odgovarajuču sintaksu za backend (Prikaz dugmeta za Pomoć vodi vas direktno "
"ondje). Ako znate komande, ali su vam potrebne dodatne informacije, možete "
"napisati  \"? <replaceable>command</replaceable>\", i kontekstna pomoć će se "
"pojaviti na desnoj strani radnog lista. Ako želite da vidite primjer radnog "
"lista, možete ići na <guimenuitem>Uvezi Primjer Radnog lista</guimenuitem> u "
"<guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> izbornik, i uvezike radni list koji su drugi "
"korisnici objavili."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To control each command entry of the worksheet you can use control buttons "
"shown at the right part of the worksheet when hovering the entry field with "
"a mouse cursor. There are three basic actions for each entry: "
"<guilabel>Evaluate Entry</guilabel> to update the result of calculations for "
"the entry, <guilabel>Drag Entry</guilabel> to move the entry at the other "
"place of the current worksheet and <guilabel>Remove Entry</guilabel> to "
"remove the entry from the current worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Da biste kontrolisali svaku komandu ulaska u radni list možete koristiti "
"kontrolnu dugmad prikazanu na desnoj strani radnog lista kada prelazite "
"kursorom miša preko. Postoje tri osnovne akcije za svaki ulazak "
"<guilabel>Evaluate Entry</guilabel> da update rezultate računanja za "
"ulazak , <guilabel>Drag Entry</guilabel> da biste prenijeli unos na drugo "
"mjesto na trenutnom radnom listu i <guilabel>Ukloni Unos</guilabel>da "
"uklonite unos na trenutnom radnom lisu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Font settings and alignment of worksheet entries can be changed using a "
"toolbar above the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Font postavke i poravnanje unosa na radni list može biti promijenjeno "
"koristeći alatnu traku iznad radnog lista."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu allows you to change some settings of "
"the appearance of your current worksheet."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu>izbornika dozvoljavaju vam da promijenite neke "
"postavke izgleda vašeg trenutnog radnog lista."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Typesetting using &latex;"
msgstr "Postavke pisanja koristeći  &latex;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting changes the way results are presented to you. If enabled, it "
"passes the result through the &latex; system, to produce visually appealing "
"formulas. For example, <quote>3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3</quote> becomes"
msgstr ""
"Postavke mijenjaju način na koji su vam rezultati predstavljeni. Ako "
"uključite, rezulatat prolazi kroz &latex; s sistem, da prikaze vizualno "
"dopadljve formule. Na primjer,  <quote>3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3</quote> postaje"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3"
msgstr "3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Syntax Highlighting"
msgstr "Isticanje Sintakse"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Syntax Highlighting increases the readability of code, by highlighting "
"keywords, or matching brackets in different colors."
msgstr ""
"Isticanje Sintakse povečava čitljivost koda, isticanje ključne riječi, ili "
"postavljanje zagrada u različitim bojama."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "Completion"
msgstr "Završetak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this is enabled, &cantor; will show you possible completions for the "
"command you are currently typing when you press the Tab-key. If there is "
"only one choice remaining, it will insert the rest of the command for you."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ovo uključeno &cantor; će vam pokazati moguće završetke za komande "
"koje upravo tipkate kad pritisnete Tab-tipku. Ako je samo jedan izbor ostao, "
"ubacit će ostatak komandi za vas."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line Numbers"
msgstr "Brojevi u Liniji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether the different expressions should have a number "
"in front. This allows you to recall older results - in Maxima, for instance, "
"this is done with the <quote>%O1</quote> command."
msgstr ""
"Ove postavke kontrolišu različite izraze koji trebaju imati broj naprijed. "
"Ovaj poziv dozvoljava da pozovete stariji rezultatu- u Maxima,na primjer, "
"ovo je urađeno sa  <quote>%O1</quote> komanda."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "Animate Worksheet"
msgstr "Animirani Radni list"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether the different animations will be used to "
"highlight changes on a worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Ove postavke kontrolišu različite animacije koje će biti korištene za "
"promjene na radnom listu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Upute za Naredbe"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
