msgstr "Glavni &cantor; prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cantor; has the common &kde; menu items, for more information read the "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus\">Menu</ulink> chapter of the "
"&kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"&cantor; ima komandu &kde; stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"ovo <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus\">Menu</ulink> chapter of "
"the &kde; Fundamentalno."

