msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:578
#, no-c-format
msgid "Developer's Guide to &cantor;"
msgstr "Programerski vodič za &cantor;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cantor; is easily extendable by plugins. You can write"
msgstr "&cantor;  je proširiv plugin. Možete napisati"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid "Backends:"
msgstr "Pozadine:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new backend enables you to use the &cantor; interface with a different "
"program."
msgstr ""
"Novi backend uključuje korištenje  &cantor; sučeljen sa drugačijim programom."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assistants:"
msgstr "Asistenti:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assistants provide dialogs to allow common tasks to be automated (such "
"entering a matrix or running a script.)"
msgstr ""
"Asistent provodi dijaloge koji dozvoljavaju uobičajne zadatke da budu "
"automatizovane ( kao što su matrice i pokrenuti skript.)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At present, there are no special developer tutorials or API documentation, "
"so if you want to write a plugin you will have to read through the sources. "
"All interface definitions are in the <filename role=\"directory\">lib</"
"filename> directory. For some example implementations, look at the plugins "
"shipped with &cantor;."
msgstr ""
"U ovom momentu nema posebnih razvijačkih tutorijala ili API dokumentacije, "
"ako želite da napišete plugin moraćete da pročitate izvore. Sve interfejs "
"definicije su u <filename role=\"directory\">lib</filename> direktorij. Na "
"primjer implementacija, pogledajte pluginove ugrađene sa&cantor;.."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i Odgovori"

#. Tag: chapter
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"
msgstr "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Menu Item <guimenuitem>Typeset using LaTeX</guimenuitem> is not available"
msgstr ""
"Stavka menija<guimenuitem> Priprema za štampu pomoću LaTeX </guimenuitem> "
"nije dostupna."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not every backend supports every option. Current version supports &latex; "
"output for Maxima, Qalculate! and Sage backends."
msgstr ""
"Ne podržava svaki backend svaku opciju. Trenutna verzija podržava &latex;  "
"priključak za Maxima, Qalculate! i Sage backends."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have installed Sage/Maxima, but the appropriate backend does not appear."
msgstr ""
"Instalirao sam  Sage/Maxima, ali odgovarajući backend se ne pojavljuje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One possible explanation is that &cantor; did not correctly detect the "
"location. Go to the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"dialog and change the <guilabel>Path</guilabel> to the appropriate "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Jedno moguće objašnjenje tog &cantor; nije tačno detektovao lokaciju. Idite  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke </guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguracija "
"&kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dijalog i promjene <guilabel>Put</"
"guilabel> za odgovarajuću aplikaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid "What a peculiar name - what does it have to do with mathematics?"
msgstr "Kakvo čudno ime- šta ima ono sa matematikom?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cantor; is named after the German mathematician <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_Cantor\">Georg Cantor</ulink>, the creator of set "
"theory."
msgstr ""
"&cantor; je dobio ime po Njemačkom matematičaru <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_Cantor\">Georg Cantor</ulink>, kreatoru ove teorije."

