#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully use &cantor;, you need &kde; 4. If you want support "
"for type-setting to be enabled, you need to install &latex; and LibSpectre. "
"To use the different Backends, the appropriate math package is required."
msgstr ""
"Da bi uredno koristili  &cantor;, trebate  &kde; 4. Ako želite podršku za "
"postavke pisanja da uključite, morate instalirati  &latex; i LibSpectre. Da "
"biste koristili različite Backends, odgovarajući matematički paket je "
"potreban."

